  "id": "task-unrelated-thoughts",
  "term": "task-unrelated thoughts",
  "definition": "Task-unrelated thoughts are thoughts or mental images that are not focused on the activity a person is currently doing. In the source material, they are treated as part of daydreaming, especially when they are independent of immediate external stimulation.",
